s for unexpected surprises that will keep you engaged throughout your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428320/extras/d3155a629b0ef297c2940f55c8c5f11b.poster.avif?t=1729638968\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428320/extras/d3155a629b0ef297c2940f55c8c5f11b.webm?t=1729638968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428320/extras/d3155a629b0ef297c2940f55c8c5f11b.mp4?t=1729638968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 7 kinds of games and brace yourself for an unforgettable experience!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1/8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2014 or newer Intel Core i5 / AMD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1/8.1/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD 64-bit capable processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia or ATi GPU with 2GB+ Memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual"],"developers":["Tiny Little Lion"],"publishers":["Boomzap Inc"],"release_date":"11 Jul, 2023"}